  <data name="UsageAccountingNote.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>Tokens = input (including cache reads/writes once) + output, for executions reporting both. Cache hit rate = reported cache reads ÷ corresponding total input; weighted by tokens, not averaged percentages. No input means no rate. Missing reports stay unknown; these are CLI-reported counts, not billing or account limits. Multi-model attribution unavailable from the CLI stays unknown.</value></data>
