  <data name="UsageCostMethodDetails.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>Cost uses recorded token counts multiplied by published standard API rates for the reported model. Only the priced subset is included; executions without a known model or required token counts remain unpriced. Missing cache details produce a range. Daily and model chart bars use the range upper bound for height and display the range in their labels.</value></data>
  <data name="UsageCostLimitations.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>This is a reference estimate, not billing data. It excludes subscription fees, tools, Fast modes, region, and tax. Cache TTL or context may be unknown, and recorded main-loop usage may omit subagents. Estimates use current local rates; optional catalog updates do not change manual rates, and no AI requests are made.</value></data>
